DOCUMENTATION TEMPLATE ONLY. This is not a .reg file and performs no changes.
After separate approval, register only the browser actually used, under HKCU:

Chrome key:
HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Google\Chrome\NativeMessagingHosts\io.mynt.local_mcp
Default REG_SZ value: C:\APPROVED\mynt-local-mcp\chromium-host.json

Firefox key:
HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Mozilla\NativeMessagingHosts\io.mynt.local_mcp
Default REG_SZ value: C:\APPROVED\mynt-local-mcp\firefox-host.json

Before changing anything, inspect whether the exact key exists. Never overwrite
an unrelated registration. Use only the verified extension/add-on ID and the
reviewed helper executable. Do not register HKLM, install a service, change UAC,
weaken any pipe ACL, or enable execution-policy bypass.

Uninstall after approval: remove only the exact io.mynt.local_mcp key/value you
created and the corresponding manifest. Leave sibling hosts and unrelated keys.
